notes.body:
Another alternative solution is to add the following function in epan/packet.c:

```c
int
call_dissector_only_new(dissector_handle_t handle, tvbuff_t *tvb,
                    packet_info *pinfo, proto_tree *tree,
                    const gboolean add_proto_name, void *data)
{
        int ret;

        DISSECTOR_ASSERT(handle != NULL);
        ret = call_dissector_work(handle, tvb, pinfo, tree, add_proto_name, data);
        return ret;
}
```

Then replace the `call_dissector_only()` function with the `call_dissector_only_new(xx,FALSE,data)` in the `reassemble_streaming_data_and_call_subdissector()` of epan/reassemble.c. This avoids increasing the value of `pinfo->curr_layer_num` when calling a subdissector. But it seems to make the `pinfo->curr_layer_num` meaningless in subdissectors.

If you think this alternative solution is better, I will cancel this MR and resubmit a new MR.

